        {
          "id": "review-main-002:hesitate-route:0",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:hesitate-route",
          "order": 1,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "right",
          "speakerName": "주인공",
          "text": "용궁에 아주 위급하게 앓고 있는 분이 있소.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-grassland",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "speakerActorKey": "R1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:hesitate-route:1",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:hesitate-route",
          "order": 2,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "right",
          "speakerName": "주인공",
          "text": "육지의 지혜가 필요하다 하여 선생께 도움을 청하러 왔소.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-grassland",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "speakerActorKey": "R1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:hesitate-route:2",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:hesitate-route",
          "order": 3,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "left",
          "speakerName": "토끼",
          "text": "이상한 부탁이구려.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-grassland",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "speakerActorKey": "L1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:hesitate-route:3",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:hesitate-route",
          "order": 4,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "left",
          "speakerName": "토끼",
          "text": "병은 의원이 고치는 줄 알았는데 이제는 토끼도 병을 고치는 세상인가?",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-grassland",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "speakerActorKey": "L1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:hesitate-route:4",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:hesitate-route",
          "order": 5,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "right",
          "speakerName": "주인공",
          "text": "그분에게는 시간이 많지 않소.\n잠시 용궁까지 함께 가주면 좋겠소.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-grassland",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "speakerActorKey": "R1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:hesitate-route:5",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:hesitate-route",
          "order": 6,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "left",
          "speakerName": "토끼",
          "text": "잠깐.\n자라 선생 얼굴이 너무 어둡소.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-grassland",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "speakerActorKey": "L1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:hesitate-route:6",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:hesitate-route",
          "order": 7,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "left",
          "speakerName": "토끼",
          "text": "혹시 내게 말하지 않은 것이 있소?",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-grassland",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "speakerActorKey": "L1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:hesitate-route:7",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:hesitate-route",
          "order": 8,
          "type": "narration",
          "speaker": "narration",
          "speakerName": "해설",
          "text": "나는 곧바로 대답하지 못했다.\n파도 소리만 한 번 밀려왔다가 빠져나갔다.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-grassland",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:hesitate-route:8",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:hesitate-route",
          "order": 9,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "right",
          "speakerName": "주인공",
          "text": "먼 길을 부탁해 미안하오.\n하지만 가는 길의 안전은 내가 책임지겠소.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-grassland",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "speakerActorKey": "R1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:hesitate-route:9",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:hesitate-route",
          "order": 10,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "right",
          "speakerName": "주인공",
          "text": "이 '바다의 숨결'을 함께 지니면 물속에서도 숨을 쉴 수 있소.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-grassland",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "speakerActorKey": "R1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:hesitate-route:10",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:hesitate-route",
          "order": 11,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "left",
          "speakerName": "토끼",
          "text": "여전히 수상하긴 하군.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-grassland",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "speakerActorKey": "L1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:hesitate-route:11",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:hesitate-route",
          "order": 12,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "left",
          "speakerName": "토끼",
          "text": "그래도 병든 이를 외면하고 돌아서기도 마음에 걸리고.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-grassland",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "speakerActorKey": "L1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:hesitate-route:12",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:hesitate-route",
          "order": 13,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "left",
          "speakerName": "토끼",
          "text": "좋소.\n딱 한 번 가보겠소.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-grassland",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "speakerActorKey": "L1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:hesitate-route:13",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:hesitate-route",
          "order": 14,
          "type": "narration",
          "speaker": "narration",
          "speakerName": "지문",
          "text": "토끼가 조심스럽게 내 등에 올라탔다.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-grassland",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:hesitate-route:14",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:hesitate-route",
          "order": 15,
          "type": "narration",
          "speaker": "narration",
          "speakerName": "해설",
          "text": "출발하기 직전 토끼는 내 얼굴을 한 번 더 살폈다.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-grassland",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ]
          },
          "flow": {
            "type": "goto",
            "targetLineId": "review-main-002:sea-route:0"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:sea-route:0",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:sea-route",
          "order": 1,
          "type": "narration",
          "speaker": "narration",
          "speakerName": "해설",
          "text": "우리는 함께 물속으로 들어갔다.\n처음에는 토끼가 몸을 잔뜩 웅크렸다.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.classic-sea",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:sea-route:1",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:sea-route",
          "order": 2,
          "type": "narration",
          "speaker": "narration",
          "speakerName": "해설",
          "text": "하지만 곧 토끼의 눈이 커졌다.\n은빛 물고기 떼가 우리 머리 위를 지나갔다.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.classic-sea",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:sea-route:2",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:sea-route",
          "order": 3,
          "type": "narration",
          "speaker": "narration",
          "speakerName": "해설",
          "text": "푸른 산호 사이에서는 조개들이 희미하게 빛났다.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.classic-sea",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:sea-route:3",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:sea-route",
          "order": 4,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "left",
          "speakerName": "토끼",
          "text": "이야.\n세상에 이런 곳도 있었군.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.classic-sea",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "speakerActorKey": "L1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:sea-route:4",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:sea-route",
          "order": 5,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "left",
          "speakerName": "토끼",
          "text": "내가 산에서는 모르는 것이 없다고 큰소리쳤는데…",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.classic-sea",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "speakerActorKey": "L1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:sea-route:5",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:sea-route",
          "order": 6,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "left",
          "speakerName": "토끼",
          "text": "오늘부터는 조금 줄여야겠소.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.classic-sea",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "speakerActorKey": "L1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:sea-route:6",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:sea-route",
          "order": 7,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "right",
          "speakerName": "주인공",
          "text": "토끼 선생도 모르는 것이 있었소?",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.classic-sea",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "speakerActorKey": "R1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:sea-route:7",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:sea-route",
          "order": 8,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "left",
          "speakerName": "토끼",
          "text": "하나쯤은 있어야 다른 동물들이 덜 억울하지 않겠소?",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.classic-sea",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "speakerActorKey": "L1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:sea-route:8",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:sea-route",
          "order": 9,
          "type": "narration",
          "speaker": "narration",
          "speakerName": "해설",
          "text": "나도 모르게 웃음이 나올 뻔했다.\n그 순간 등에 올라탄 토끼의 무게가 다시 또렷하게 느껴졌다.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.classic-sea",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:sea-route:9",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:sea-route",
          "order": 10,
          "type": "narration",
          "speaker": "narration",
          "speakerName": "자라의 생각",
          "text": "이 토끼는 자신이 어디로 가는지도 모른다.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.classic-sea",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:sea-route:10",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:sea-route",
          "order": 11,
          "type": "narration",
          "speaker": "narration",
          "speakerName": "해설",
          "text": "나는 아무 말 없이 더 깊은 바다로 헤엄쳤다.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.classic-sea",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ]
          },
          "flow": {
            "type": "goto",
            "targetLineId": "review-main-002:palace:0"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:palace:0",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:palace",
          "order": 1,
          "type": "narration",
          "speaker": "narration",
          "speakerName": "해설",
          "text": "마침내 용궁 대청 문이 열렸다.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:palace:1",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:palace",
          "order": 2,
          "type": "narration",
          "speaker": "narration",
          "speakerName": "해설",
          "text": "하지만 안에는 잔치 음식도, 반갑게 맞는 신하들도 없었다.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:palace:2",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:palace",
          "order": 3,
          "type": "narration",
          "speaker": "narration",
          "speakerName": "해설",
          "text": "넓은 대청 한가운데 방석 하나만 덩그러니 놓여 있었다.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:palace:3",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:palace",
          "order": 4,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "left",
          "speakerName": "토끼",
          "text": "이상하군.\n잔치라면 상부터 보여야 하고…",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "speakerActorKey": "L1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:palace:4",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:palace",
          "order": 5,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "left",
          "speakerName": "토끼",
          "text": "병자를 만나러 왔다면 병자부터 보여야 하는 것 아니오?",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "speakerActorKey": "L1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:palace:5",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:palace",
          "order": 6,
          "type": "narration",
          "speaker": "narration",
          "speakerName": "지문",
          "text": "어두운 기둥 뒤에서 무장한 호위들이 모습을 드러냈다.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:palace:6",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:palace",
          "order": 7,
          "type": "narration",
          "speaker": "narration",
          "speakerName": "지문",
          "text": "밧줄과 그물이 토끼를 둘러쌌다.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:palace:7",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:palace",
          "order": 8,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "left",
          "speakerName": "토끼",
          "text": "……아하.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "speakerActorKey": "L1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:palace:8",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:palace",
          "order": 9,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "left",
          "speakerName": "토끼",
          "text": "이제야 자라 선생이 빼놓고 온 말이 무엇인지 알겠군.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "speakerActorKey": "L1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:palace:9",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:palace",
          "order": 10,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "left",
          "speakerName": "의관",
          "text": "전하!\n토끼가 도착했습니다.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.physician-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.physician-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "speakerActorKey": "L1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:palace:10",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:palace",
          "order": 11,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "left",
          "speakerName": "의관",
          "text": "더 늦기 전에 처방을 시작해야 합니다.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.physician-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.physician-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "speakerActorKey": "L1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:palace:11",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:palace",
          "order": 12,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "left",
          "speakerName": "의관",
          "text": "어서 토끼의 간을 꺼내야 합니다.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.physician-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.physician-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "speakerActorKey": "L1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:palace:12",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:palace",
          "order": 13,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "left",
          "speakerName": "토끼",
          "text": "처방?\n무슨 처방 말이오?",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.physician-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.physician-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "speakerActorKey": "L1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:palace:13",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:palace",
          "order": 14,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "left",
          "speakerName": "의관",
          "text": "전하의 병에는 토끼의 간이 필요하다.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.physician-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.physician-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "speakerActorKey": "L1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:palace:14",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:palace",
          "order": 15,
          "type": "narration",
          "speaker": "narration",
          "speakerName": "해설",
          "text": "토끼의 얼굴에서 웃음기가 사라졌다.\n그는 천천히 나를 돌아보았다.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.physician-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.physician-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:palace:15",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:palace",
          "order": 16,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "left",
          "speakerName": "토끼",
          "text": "자라 선생.\n잔치 이야기를 했든…",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.physician-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.physician-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "speakerActorKey": "L1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:palace:16",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:palace",
          "order": 17,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "left",
          "speakerName": "토끼",
          "text": "병든 이를 도와달라고 했든…",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.physician-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.physician-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "speakerActorKey": "L1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:palace:17",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:palace",
          "order": 18,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "left",
          "speakerName": "토끼",
          "text": "가장 중요한 이야기는 한마디도 하지 않았구려.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.physician-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.physician-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "speakerActorKey": "L1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:palace:18",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:palace",
          "order": 19,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "left",
          "speakerName": "토끼",
          "text": "내가 죽을 수도 있다는 말 말이오.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.physician-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.physician-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "speakerActorKey": "L1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:palace:19",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:palace",
          "order": 20,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "left",
          "speakerName": "주인공",
          "text": "…….",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.physician-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.physician-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "speakerActorKey": "L1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:palace:20",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:palace",
          "order": 21,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "left",
          "speakerName": "용왕",
          "text": "토끼 선생.\n나 또한 그대를 이런 방법으로 데려오고 싶지는 않았소.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "speakerActorKey": "L1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:palace:21",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:palace",
          "order": 22,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "left",
          "speakerName": "토끼",
          "text": "그 말씀을 듣고 기뻐해야 할지 모르겠군요.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "speakerActorKey": "L1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:palace:22",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:palace",
          "order": 23,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "left",
          "speakerName": "용왕",
          "text": "하지만 내게 남은 시간이 거의 없소.\n……미안하오.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "speakerActorKey": "L1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:palace:23",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:palace",
          "order": 24,
          "type": "narration",
          "speaker": "narration",
          "speakerName": "지문",
          "text": "용왕님이 힘겹게 손을 들어 올렸다.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:palace:24",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:palace",
          "order": 25,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "left",
          "speakerName": "용왕",
          "text": "토끼를 붙잡아라.\n처방을 시작하라.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "speakerActorKey": "L1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:palace:25",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:palace",
          "order": 26,
          "type": "narration",
          "speaker": "narration",
          "speakerName": "해설",
          "text": "호위들이 다가왔다.\n토끼의 귀가 천천히 아래로 처졌다.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:palace:26",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:palace",
          "order": 27,
          "type": "narration",
          "speaker": "narration",
          "speakerName": "해설",
          "text": "그제야 나는 토끼가 정말 겁에 질렸다는 것을 알았다.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:palace:27",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:palace",
          "order": 28,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "left",
          "speakerName": "토끼",
          "text": "잠깐!\n모두 멈추시오!",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
              }
            ],
            "speakerActorKey": "L1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:palace:28",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:palace",
          "order": 29,
          "type": "narration",
          "speaker": "narration",
          "speakerName": "해설",
          "text": "토끼가 갑자기 목소리를 높였다.\n떨리던 눈빛도 어느새 달라져 있었다.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:palace:29",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:palace",
          "order": 30,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "left",
          "speakerName": "토끼",
          "text": "이렇게 귀한 약을 찾으면서 그것이 어디 있는지도 모르셨습니까?",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
              }
            ],
            "speakerActorKey": "L1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:palace:30",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:palace",
          "order": 31,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "left",
          "speakerName": "토끼",
          "text": "제 간은 지금 제 몸속에 없습니다.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
              }
            ],
            "speakerActorKey": "L1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:palace:31",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:palace",
          "order": 32,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "left",
          "speakerName": "용왕",
          "text": "뭐라고?",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "speakerActorKey": "L1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:palace:32",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:palace",
          "order": 33,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "left",
          "speakerName": "토끼",
          "text": "산짐승이라고 간을 늘 몸속에 넣고 다니는 줄 아셨습니까?",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
              }
            ],
            "speakerActorKey": "L1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:palace:33",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:palace",
          "order": 34,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "left",
          "speakerName": "토끼",
          "text": "저는 멀리 다닐 때면 간을 꺼내 안전한 곳에 두곤 합니다.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
              }
            ],
            "speakerActorKey": "L1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:palace:34",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:palace",
          "order": 35,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "left",
          "speakerName": "토끼",
          "text": "오늘도 산 아래 바위 밑에 잎사귀로 싸 두고 왔습니다.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
              }
            ],
            "speakerActorKey": "L1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:palace:35",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:palace",
          "order": 36,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "left",
          "speakerName": "의관",
          "text": "그런 일이 있을 수 있습니까?",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.physician-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.physician-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "speakerActorKey": "L1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:palace:36",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:palace",
          "order": 37,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "left",
          "speakerName": "토끼",
          "text": "그러니 직접 확인해 보십시오.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
              }
            ],
            "speakerActorKey": "L1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:palace:37",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:palace",
          "order": 38,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "left",
          "speakerName": "토끼",
          "text": "지금 제 배를 갈랐다가 간이 없으면 어떻게 하시겠습니까?",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
              }
            ],
            "speakerActorKey": "L1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:palace:38",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:palace",
          "order": 39,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "left",
          "speakerName": "토끼",
          "text": "전하의 마지막 기회만 사라지는 것 아닙니까?",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
              }
            ],
            "speakerActorKey": "L1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:palace:39",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:palace",
          "order": 40,
          "type": "narration",
          "speaker": "narration",
          "speakerName": "해설",
          "text": "말도 안 되는 이야기였다.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:palace:40",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:palace",
          "order": 41,
          "type": "narration",
          "speaker": "narration",
          "speakerName": "해설",
          "text": "하지만 너무 태연하게 말하니 신하들이 서로 얼굴을 바라보았다.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:palace:41",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:palace",
          "order": 42,
          "type": "narration",
          "speaker": "narration",
          "speakerName": "해설",
          "text": "용왕님도 선뜻 명령을 내리지 못했다.\n그러다 나를 바라보았다.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:palace:42",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:palace",
          "order": 43,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "left",
          "speakerName": "용왕",
          "text": "자라야.\n너는 평생 내 앞에서 사실을 숨긴 적이 거의 없었다.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "speakerActorKey": "L1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:palace:43",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:palace",
          "order": 44,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "left",
          "speakerName": "용왕",
          "text": "육지 가까운 곳에서 태어난 네가 우리보다 육지 생물을 더 잘 알겠지.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "speakerActorKey": "L1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:palace:44",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:palace",
          "order": 45,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "left",
          "speakerName": "용왕",
          "text": "저 토끼의 말을 어떻게 생각하느냐?",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "speakerActorKey": "L1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:palace:45",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:palace",
          "order": 46,
          "type": "narration",
          "speaker": "narration",
          "speakerName": "해설",
          "text": "나는 토끼를 바라보았다.\n토끼도 말없이 나를 바라보고 있었다.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:palace:46",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:palace",
          "order": 47,
          "type": "narration",
          "speaker": "narration",
          "speakerName": "자라의 생각",
          "text": "간을 몸 밖에 꺼내 두고 살아갈 수 없다는 것쯤은 나도 안다.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:palace:47",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:palace",
          "order": 48,
          "type": "narration",
          "speaker": "narration",
          "speakerName": "자라의 생각",
          "text": "사실대로 말한다면 용왕님을 살릴 수 있다.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:palace:48",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:palace",
          "order": 49,
          "type": "narration",
          "speaker": "narration",
          "speakerName": "자라의 생각",
          "text": "하지만 그 순간 토끼의 마지막 기회는 사라진다.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:palace:49",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:palace",
          "order": 50,
          "type": "narration",
          "speaker": "narration",
          "speakerName": "자라의 생각",
          "text": "반대로 모른 척한다면 토끼를 육지로 데려갈 틈을 만들 수 있다.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:palace:50",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:palace",
          "order": 51,
          "type": "narration",
          "speaker": "narration",
          "speakerName": "자라의 생각",
          "text": "대신 이번에는 내 선택으로 용왕님을 속이게 된다.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:palace:51",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:palace",
          "order": 52,
          "type": "narration",
          "speaker": "narration",
          "speakerName": "해설",
          "text": "이번에는 누구의 명령도 아니었다.\n내가 직접 선택해야 했다.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:palace:52",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:palace",
          "order": 53,
          "type": "narration",
          "speaker": "narration",
          "speakerName": "해설",
          "text": "용왕은 나의 대답을 기다리고 있다.\n이번 한마디는\n토끼의 생사와 용왕의 신뢰를 함께 가른다.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ]
          },
          "flow": {
            "type": "choice",
            "options": [
              {
                "id": "truth",
                "label": "간을 몸 밖에 둘 수 없다고 말한다.",
                "targetLineId": "review-main-002:ending-1:0"
              },
              {
                "id": "shield",
                "label": "직접 확인해야 한다고 말해 육지로 갈 기회를 만든다.",
                "targetLineId": "review-main-002:shield-route:0"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:ending-1:0",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:ending-1",
          "order": 1,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "right",
          "speakerName": "주인공",
          "text": "전하.\n토끼의 말은 사실이 아닙니다.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "speakerActorKey": "R1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:ending-1:1",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:ending-1",
          "order": 2,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "right",
          "speakerName": "주인공",
          "text": "살아 있는 동물이 간을 몸 밖에 꺼내 두고 다닐 수는 없습니다.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "speakerActorKey": "R1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:ending-1:2",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:ending-1",
          "order": 3,
          "type": "narration",
          "speaker": "narration",
          "speakerName": "해설",
          "text": "대청 안이 조용해졌다.\n토끼는 잠시 눈을 감았다.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:ending-1:3",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:ending-1",
          "order": 4,
          "type": "narration",
          "speaker": "narration",
          "speakerName": "해설",
          "text": "그리고 다시 나를 바라보았다.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:ending-1:4",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:ending-1",
          "order": 5,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "left",
          "speakerName": "토끼",
          "text": "그래요.\n이번에는 사실을 말했군요.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "speakerActorKey": "L1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:ending-1:5",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:ending-1",
          "order": 6,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "left",
          "speakerName": "토끼",
          "text": "그런데 자라 선생.\n처음 만났을 때도 그 사실들을 말해 주었다면…",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "speakerActorKey": "L1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:ending-1:6",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:ending-1",
          "order": 7,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "left",
          "speakerName": "토끼",
          "text": "나는 여기까지 오지 않았겠지요.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "speakerActorKey": "L1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:ending-1:7",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:ending-1",
          "order": 8,
          "type": "narration",
          "speaker": "narration",
          "speakerName": "해설",
          "text": "나는 대답하지 못했다.\n호위들이 토끼를 데리고 대청 밖으로 향했다.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:ending-1:8",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:ending-1",
          "order": 9,
          "type": "narration",
          "speaker": "narration",
          "speakerName": "해설",
          "text": "토끼는 더 이상 살려 달라고 외치지 않았다.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:ending-1:9",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:ending-1",
          "order": 10,
          "type": "narration",
          "speaker": "narration",
          "speakerName": "해설",
          "text": "문이 닫히기 직전 긴 귀 끝만 잠시 보였다가 사라졌다.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:ending-1:10",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:ending-1",
          "order": 11,
          "type": "narration",
          "speaker": "narration",
          "speakerName": "해설",
          "text": "며칠 뒤 용왕님은 자리를 털고 일어났다.\n\n용궁에는 다시 밝은 조개등이 켜졌다.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-recovered-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-recovered-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:ending-1:11",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:ending-1",
          "order": 12,
          "type": "narration",
          "speaker": "narration",
          "speakerName": "해설",
          "text": "신하들은 나라를 살린 공을 세웠다며 나를 칭찬했다.\n\n용왕님도 내 목에 황금 훈장을 걸어 주었다.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-recovered-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-recovered-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:ending-1:12",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:ending-1",
          "order": 13,
          "type": "narration",
          "speaker": "narration",
          "speakerName": "해설",
          "text": "목에는 오래전 받은 '바다의 숨결'과 새로 받은 훈장이 나란히 걸려 있었다.\n\n하지만 대청 한쪽에는 토끼가 앉았던 빈 방석이 남아 있었다.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-recovered-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-recovered-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:ending-1:13",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:ending-1",
          "order": 14,
          "type": "narration",
          "speaker": "narration",
          "speakerName": "해설",
          "text": "나는 용왕 앞에서 거짓말을 하지 않았다.\n\n그렇다고 처음부터 토끼에게 사실을 숨겼던 일이 없어지는 것은 아니었다.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-recovered-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-recovered-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:ending-1:14",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:ending-1",
          "order": 15,
          "type": "narration",
          "speaker": "narration",
          "speakerName": "해설",
          "text": "왕은 살아났다.\n\n용궁도 평화를 되찾았다.\n\n그 모든 것을 바라보면서도 나는 가끔 빈 방석 앞에서 발걸음을 멈췄다.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-recovered-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-recovered-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:ending-1:15",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:ending-1",
          "order": 16,
          "type": "narration",
          "speaker": "narration",
          "speakerName": "해설",
          "text": "「진실을 말한 자라」\n\n[생각해 보기]\n용왕에게 사실을 말한 자라는 무엇을 지켰을까?\n그리고 그 선택으로 무엇을 잃었을까?",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-recovered-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-recovered-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ]
          },
          "flow": {
            "type": "goto",
            "targetLineId": null
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:shield-route:0",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:shield-route",
          "order": 1,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "right",
          "speakerName": "주인공",
          "text": "전하.\n저도 토끼의 말을 그대로 믿기는 어렵습니다.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "speakerActorKey": "R1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:shield-route:1",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:shield-route",
          "order": 2,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "right",
          "speakerName": "주인공",
          "text": "하지만 지금 여기서 토끼를 죽였다가 정말 간이 없다면…",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "speakerActorKey": "R1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:shield-route:2",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:shield-route",
          "order": 3,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "right",
          "speakerName": "주인공",
          "text": "다시는 기회가 없습니다.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "speakerActorKey": "R1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:shield-route:3",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:shield-route",
          "order": 4,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "left",
          "speakerName": "용왕",
          "text": "그래서 어떻게 하겠다는 것이냐?",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "speakerActorKey": "L1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:shield-route:4",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:shield-route",
          "order": 5,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "right",
          "speakerName": "주인공",
          "text": "제가 직접 토끼와 육지로 가겠습니다.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "speakerActorKey": "R1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:shield-route:5",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:shield-route",
          "order": 6,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "right",
          "speakerName": "주인공",
          "text": "간이 있다는 곳을 제 눈으로 확인하겠습니다.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "speakerActorKey": "R1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:shield-route:6",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:shield-route",
          "order": 7,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "right",
          "speakerName": "주인공",
          "text": "그리고 약이 될 것을 반드시 가져오겠습니다.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "speakerActorKey": "R1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:shield-route:7",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:shield-route",
          "order": 8,
          "type": "narration",
          "speaker": "narration",
          "speakerName": "해설",
          "text": "용왕님의 눈이 가늘어졌다.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:shield-route:8",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:shield-route",
          "order": 9,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "left",
          "speakerName": "용왕",
          "text": "자라야.\n너는 정말 확인하러 가는 것이냐?",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "speakerActorKey": "L1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:shield-route:9",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:shield-route",
          "order": 10,
          "type": "narration",
          "speaker": "narration",
          "speakerName": "해설",
          "text": "가슴이 철렁 내려앉았다.\n용왕님은 내 마음속까지 들여다보는 것 같았다.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:shield-route:10",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:shield-route",
          "order": 11,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "right",
          "speakerName": "주인공",
          "text": "……제가 다녀오겠습니다.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
