        {
          "id": "review-main-002:shield-route:11",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:shield-route",
          "order": 12,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "left",
          "speakerName": "용왕",
          "text": "좋다.\n나는 지금까지 네 말을 믿어 왔다.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "speakerActorKey": "L1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:shield-route:12",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:shield-route",
          "order": 13,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "left",
          "speakerName": "용왕",
          "text": "이번에도 믿어 보겠다.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "speakerActorKey": "L1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:shield-route:13",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:shield-route",
          "order": 14,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "left",
          "speakerName": "용왕",
          "text": "하지만 빈손으로 돌아온다면 그 결과도 네가 감당해야 할 것이다.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "speakerActorKey": "L1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:shield-route:14",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:shield-route",
          "order": 15,
          "type": "narration",
          "speaker": "narration",
          "speakerName": "지문",
          "text": "호위들이 토끼를 묶은 줄을 풀었다.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.classic-sea",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:shield-route:15",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:shield-route",
          "order": 16,
          "type": "narration",
          "speaker": "narration",
          "speakerName": "해설",
          "text": "토끼는 한동안 자리에서 일어나지 못했다.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.classic-sea",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:shield-route:16",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:shield-route",
          "order": 17,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "right",
          "speakerName": "주인공",
          "text": "올라타시오.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.classic-sea",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "speakerActorKey": "R1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:shield-route:17",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:shield-route",
          "order": 18,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "left",
          "speakerName": "토끼",
          "text": "이번에도 자라 선생 등을 믿어도 되는 겁니까?",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.classic-sea",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "speakerActorKey": "L1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:shield-route:18",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:shield-route",
          "order": 19,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "right",
          "speakerName": "주인공",
          "text": "……육지까지는 반드시 데려다주겠소.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.classic-sea",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "speakerActorKey": "R1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:shield-route:19",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:shield-route",
          "order": 20,
          "type": "narration",
          "speaker": "narration",
          "speakerName": "해설",
          "text": "토끼는 아무 말 없이 내 등에 올라탔다.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.classic-sea",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:shield-route:20",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:shield-route",
          "order": 21,
          "type": "narration",
          "speaker": "narration",
          "speakerName": "해설",
          "text": "우리는 용궁 문을 지나 어두운 바다를 헤엄쳐 올라갔다.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.classic-sea",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:shield-route:21",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:shield-route",
          "order": 22,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "left",
          "speakerName": "토끼",
          "text": "자라 선생.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.classic-sea",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "speakerActorKey": "L1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:shield-route:22",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:shield-route",
          "order": 23,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "right",
          "speakerName": "주인공",
          "text": "왜 그러시오?",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.classic-sea",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "speakerActorKey": "R1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:shield-route:23",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:shield-route",
          "order": 24,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "left",
          "speakerName": "토끼",
          "text": "아니오.\n육지에 도착하면 이야기합시다.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.classic-sea",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "speakerActorKey": "L1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:shield-route:24",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:shield-route",
          "order": 25,
          "type": "narration",
          "speaker": "narration",
          "speakerName": "해설",
          "text": "그 뒤로 토끼는 아무 말도 하지 않았다.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.classic-sea",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:shield-route:25",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:shield-route",
          "order": 26,
          "type": "narration",
          "speaker": "narration",
          "speakerName": "해설",
          "text": "등 뒤에서 느껴지는 숨소리만 물살 사이로 이어졌다.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.classic-sea",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:shield-route:26",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:shield-route",
          "order": 27,
          "type": "narration",
          "speaker": "narration",
          "speakerName": "자라의 생각",
          "text": "나는 용왕님을 속였다.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.classic-sea",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:shield-route:27",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:shield-route",
          "order": 28,
          "type": "narration",
          "speaker": "narration",
          "speakerName": "자라의 생각",
          "text": "이번에는 누군가의 명령 때문도 아니었다.\n내가 선택해서 한 일이었다.",
