          "chapterId": "review-main-002:shoreAfterShield",
          "order": 6,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "left",
          "speakerName": "토끼",
          "text": "세상에 자기 간을 꺼내 바위 밑에 두고 다니는 토끼가 어디 있겠소?",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-shore-escape",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "speakerActorKey": "L1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:shoreAfterShield:6",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:shoreAfterShield",
          "order": 7,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "right",
          "speakerName": "주인공",
          "text": "……역시 그랬군.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-shore-escape",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "speakerActorKey": "R1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:shoreAfterShield:7",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:shoreAfterShield",
          "order": 8,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "left",
          "speakerName": "토끼",
          "text": "그 자리에서 살아 나가려면 뭐라도 말해야 했소.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-shore-escape",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "speakerActorKey": "L1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:shoreAfterShield:8",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:shoreAfterShield",
          "order": 9,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "left",
          "speakerName": "토끼",
          "text": "생각할 시간도 없었지.\n입에서 가장 먼저 나온 거짓말을 붙잡았을 뿐이오.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-shore-escape",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "speakerActorKey": "L1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:shoreAfterShield:9",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:shoreAfterShield",
          "order": 10,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "right",
          "speakerName": "주인공",
          "text": "알고 있었소.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-shore-escape",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "speakerActorKey": "R1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:shoreAfterShield:10",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:shoreAfterShield",
          "order": 11,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "left",
          "speakerName": "토끼",
          "text": "알면서…\n내 말에 맞춰 준 거요?",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-shore-escape",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "speakerActorKey": "L1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:shoreAfterShield:11",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:shoreAfterShield",
          "order": 12,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "right",
          "speakerName": "주인공",
          "text": "그렇소.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-shore-escape",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "speakerActorKey": "R1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:shoreAfterShield:12",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:shoreAfterShield",
          "order": 13,
          "type": "narration",
          "speaker": "narration",
          "speakerName": "해설",
          "text": "토끼는 한동안 아무 말도 하지 않았다.\n겨울바람이 젖은 털을 흔들었다.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-shore-escape",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:shoreAfterShield:13",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:shoreAfterShield",
          "order": 14,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "left",
          "speakerName": "토끼",
          "text": "자라 선생.\n나는 아직도 당신이 나를 속인 일이 화가 나오.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-shore-escape",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "speakerActorKey": "L1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:shoreAfterShield:14",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:shoreAfterShield",
          "order": 15,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "right",
          "speakerName": "주인공",
          "text": "알고 있소.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-shore-escape",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "speakerActorKey": "R1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:shoreAfterShield:15",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:shoreAfterShield",
          "order": 16,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "left",
          "speakerName": "토끼",
          "text": "그렇다고 용궁에서 나를 살려 준 일까지…",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-shore-escape",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "speakerActorKey": "L1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:shoreAfterShield:16",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:shoreAfterShield",
          "order": 17,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "left",
          "speakerName": "토끼",
          "text": "없던 일이 되는 것은 아니오.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-shore-escape",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "speakerActorKey": "L1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:shoreAfterShield:17",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:shoreAfterShield",
          "order": 18,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "left",
          "speakerName": "토끼",
          "text": "나를 속인 것도 당신이고,\n살아 돌아올 틈을 만든 것도 당신이오.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-shore-escape",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "speakerActorKey": "L1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:shoreAfterShield:18",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:shoreAfterShield",
          "order": 19,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "left",
          "speakerName": "토끼",
          "text": "두 일 중 하나가 다른 하나를 지워 주지는 않겠지요.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-shore-escape",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "speakerActorKey": "L1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:shoreAfterShield:19",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:shoreAfterShield",
          "order": 20,
          "type": "narration",
          "speaker": "narration",
          "speakerName": "해설",
          "text": "그 말에 나는 아무런 대답도 할 수 없었다.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-shore-escape",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:shoreAfterShield:20",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:shoreAfterShield",
          "order": 21,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "left",
          "speakerName": "토끼",
          "text": "나는 이제 돌아가겠소.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-shore-escape",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "speakerActorKey": "L1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:shoreAfterShield:21",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:shoreAfterShield",
          "order": 22,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "left",
          "speakerName": "토끼",
          "text": "가족들이 내가 사라졌다고 온 산을 뒤지고 있을 테니까.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-shore-escape",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "speakerActorKey": "L1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:shoreAfterShield:22",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:shoreAfterShield",
          "order": 23,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "right",
          "speakerName": "주인공",
          "text": "토끼 선생.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-shore-escape",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "speakerActorKey": "R1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:shoreAfterShield:23",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:shoreAfterShield",
          "order": 24,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "left",
          "speakerName": "토끼",
          "text": "다시는 남을 용궁으로 초대하는 일은 하지 마시오.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-shore-escape",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "speakerActorKey": "L1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:shoreAfterShield:24",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:shoreAfterShield",
          "order": 25,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "left",
          "speakerName": "토끼",
          "text": "자라 선생은 그런 일에 영 소질이 없소.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-shore-escape",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "speakerActorKey": "L1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:shoreAfterShield:25",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:shoreAfterShield",
          "order": 26,
          "type": "narration",
          "speaker": "narration",
          "speakerName": "지문",
          "text": "토끼는 아주 조금 웃었다.\n그리고 몸을 돌려 숲으로 뛰어갔다.",
          "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-shore-escape",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [
              {
                "key": "L1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:shoreAfterShield:26",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:shoreAfterShield",
          "order": 27,
          "type": "narration",
          "speaker": "narration",
          "speakerName": "해설",
          "text": "몇 번의 뜀박질 뒤 긴 귀가 풀숲 너머로 사라졌다.",
          "leftAssetId": "",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-shore-escape",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:shoreAfterShield:27",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:shoreAfterShield",
          "order": 28,
          "type": "narration",
          "speaker": "narration",
          "speakerName": "해설",
          "text": "모래 위에는 나 혼자 남았다.",
          "leftAssetId": "",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-shore-escape",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:shoreAfterShield:28",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:shoreAfterShield",
          "order": 29,
          "type": "narration",
          "speaker": "narration",
          "speakerName": "자라의 생각",
          "text": "토끼는 살았다.\n하지만 내 손에는 용왕님을 살릴 약이 없다.",
          "leftAssetId": "",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-shore-escape",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:shoreAfterShield:29",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:shoreAfterShield",
          "order": 30,
          "type": "narration",
          "speaker": "narration",
          "speakerName": "자라의 생각",
          "text": "용궁으로 돌아가면 내가 한 일을 직접 말해야 한다.",
          "leftAssetId": "",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-shore-escape",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:shoreAfterShield:30",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:shoreAfterShield",
          "order": 31,
          "type": "narration",
          "speaker": "narration",
          "speakerName": "자라의 생각",
          "text": "어떤 벌을 받을지도 모른다.",
          "leftAssetId": "",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-shore-escape",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:shoreAfterShield:31",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:shoreAfterShield",
          "order": 32,
          "type": "narration",
          "speaker": "narration",
          "speakerName": "자라의 생각",
          "text": "돌아가지 않는다면 토끼를 다시 쫓지 않아도 된다.",
          "leftAssetId": "",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-shore-escape",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:shoreAfterShield:32",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:shoreAfterShield",
          "order": 33,
          "type": "narration",
          "speaker": "narration",
          "speakerName": "자라의 생각",
          "text": "나 역시 용궁의 명령에서 벗어날 수 있다.",
          "leftAssetId": "",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-shore-escape",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:shoreAfterShield:33",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:shoreAfterShield",
          "order": 34,
          "type": "narration",
          "speaker": "narration",
          "speakerName": "자라의 생각",
          "text": "하지만 나를 기다리는 용왕님에게 아무 설명도 남기지 않게 된다.",
          "leftAssetId": "",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-shore-escape",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:shoreAfterShield:34",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:shoreAfterShield",
          "order": 35,
          "type": "narration",
          "speaker": "narration",
          "speakerName": "해설",
          "text": "목에 걸린 '바다의 숨결'이 새벽빛을 받아 희미하게 빛났다.",
          "leftAssetId": "",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-shore-escape",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:shoreAfterShield:35",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:shoreAfterShield",
          "order": 36,
          "type": "narration",
          "speaker": "narration",
          "speakerName": "자라의 생각",
          "text": "이제 마지막으로 정해야 한다.",
          "leftAssetId": "",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-shore-escape",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:shoreAfterShield:36",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:shoreAfterShield",
          "order": 37,
          "type": "narration",
          "speaker": "narration",
          "speakerName": "자라의 생각",
          "text": "나는 내가 한 선택 뒤에 어떻게 남을 것인가.",
          "leftAssetId": "",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-shore-escape",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:shoreAfterShield:37",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:shoreAfterShield",
          "order": 38,
          "type": "narration",
          "speaker": "narration",
          "speakerName": "해설",
          "text": "토끼는 숲속으로 사라졌다.\n용왕은 아직\n나를 기다리고 있을 것이다.",
          "leftAssetId": "",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-shore-escape",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ]
          },
          "flow": {
            "type": "choice",
            "options": [
              {
                "id": "exile",
                "label": "용궁으로 돌아가지 않는다.",
                "targetLineId": "review-main-002:ending-2:0"
              },
              {
                "id": "return",
                "label": "용궁으로 돌아가 모든 일을 직접 말한다.",
                "targetLineId": "review-main-002:ending-3:0"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:ending-2:0",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:ending-2",
          "order": 1,
          "type": "narration",
          "speaker": "narration",
          "speakerName": "해설",
          "text": "나는 오랫동안 바다를 바라보았다.",
          "leftAssetId": "",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-river-winter",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:ending-2:1",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:ending-2",
          "order": 2,
          "type": "narration",
          "speaker": "narration",
          "speakerName": "해설",
          "text": "그러나 끝내 물속으로 들어가지 않았다.",
          "leftAssetId": "",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-river-winter",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:ending-2:2",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:ending-2",
          "order": 3,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "right",
          "speakerName": "주인공",
          "text": "……여기까지 하겠습니다, 전하.",
          "leftAssetId": "",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-river-winter",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ],
            "speakerActorKey": "R1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:ending-2:3",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:ending-2",
          "order": 4,
          "type": "narration",
          "speaker": "narration",
          "speakerName": "해설",
          "text": "누구에게 하는 말인지 나 자신도 알 수 없었다.",
          "leftAssetId": "",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-river-winter",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:ending-2:4",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:ending-2",
          "order": 5,
          "type": "narration",
          "speaker": "narration",
          "speakerName": "해설",
          "text": "나는 목에 걸린 '바다의 숨결'을 풀었다.",
          "leftAssetId": "",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-river-winter",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:ending-2:5",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:ending-2",
          "order": 6,
          "type": "narration",
          "speaker": "narration",
          "speakerName": "해설",
          "text": "어린 나를 살려 주었던 징표였다.",
          "leftAssetId": "",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-river-winter",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:ending-2:6",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:ending-2",
          "order": 7,
          "type": "narration",
          "speaker": "narration",
          "speakerName": "해설",
          "text": "그리고 오랫동안 내가 용궁의 신하라는 것을 알려 준 징표였다.",
          "leftAssetId": "",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-river-winter",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:ending-2:7",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:ending-2",
          "order": 8,
          "type": "narration",
          "speaker": "narration",
          "speakerName": "지문",
          "text": "나는 그것을 파도가 닿는 바위 위에 내려놓았다.",
          "leftAssetId": "",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-river-winter",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:ending-2:8",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:ending-2",
          "order": 9,
          "type": "narration",
          "speaker": "narration",
          "speakerName": "해설",
          "text": "그리고 바다를 등졌다.",
          "leftAssetId": "",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-river-winter",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:ending-2:9",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:ending-2",
          "order": 10,
          "type": "narration",
          "speaker": "narration",
          "speakerName": "해설",
          "text": "그 뒤 나는 깊은 강과 연못을 옮겨 다니며 살았다.",
          "leftAssetId": "",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-river-winter",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:ending-2:10",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:ending-2",
          "order": 11,
          "type": "narration",
          "speaker": "narration",
          "speakerName": "해설",
          "text": "'바다의 숨결'이 없어진 뒤에는 예전처럼 오랫동안 짠물에 머물 수 없었다.\n\n그래서 다시는 용궁으로 돌아가지 않았다.",
          "leftAssetId": "",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-river-winter",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:ending-2:11",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:ending-2",
          "order": 12,
          "type": "narration",
          "speaker": "narration",
          "speakerName": "해설",
          "text": "나는 용왕님이 그 뒤 어떻게 되었는지도 직접 확인하지 못했다.\n\n때때로 바다에서 올라온 물고기에게 소식을 물어볼까 생각했지만, 매번 입을 열지 못했다.",
          "leftAssetId": "",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-river-winter",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:ending-2:12",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:ending-2",
          "order": 13,
          "type": "narration",
          "speaker": "narration",
          "speakerName": "해설",
          "text": "토끼가 살아 있다는 사실을 떠올리면 마음 한쪽이 놓였고,\n용궁에 아무 설명도 남기지 않았다는 생각이 들면 또 다른 한쪽이 무거워졌다.",
          "leftAssetId": "",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-river-winter",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:ending-2:13",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:ending-2",
          "order": 14,
          "type": "narration",
          "speaker": "narration",
          "speakerName": "해설",
          "text": "세월이 흘러도 둘 중 하나만 남지는 않았다.\n\n나는 그렇게 바다에서 멀어진 강물 속에서 살아갔다.",
          "leftAssetId": "",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-river-winter",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "review-main-002:ending-2:14",
          "chapterId": "review-main-002:ending-2",
          "order": 15,
          "type": "narration",
          "speaker": "narration",
          "speakerName": "해설",
          "text": "「돌아가지 않은 길」\n\n[생각해 보기]\n용궁으로 돌아가지 않은 것은 자신의 선택을 끝까지 지킨 행동이었을까?\n아니면 설명하고 책임질 기회를 놓친 행동이었을까?",
          "leftAssetId": "",
          "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
          "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-river-winter",
          "purposeNote": "",
          "emotionNote": "",
          "directionNote": "",
          "stageComposition": {
            "leftActors": [],
            "rightActors": [
              {
                "key": "R1",
                "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
